cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "MicrobioRel-RE: model predictions over a gut microbiome corpus"
message: >-
  These are unvalidated model predictions. Please cite the MicrobioRel preprint
  (see preferred-citation) and contact the authors before use, so that the
  validation status of this prediction set is represented accurately.
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Oumaima
    family-names: TODO
    affiliation: "LS2N, Nantes Universite"
    orcid: TODO
abstract: >-
  Relations between six entity types (Species, Disease, Chemical, Gene,
  CellLine, Mutation) predicted by the MicrobioRel relation extraction model
  over the full text of 52 open-access gut microbiome articles. 8436 predicted
  relations across 2786 passages. No row has been manually validated. The
  annotated corpus, annotation guidelines and training code are in a separate
  repository, github.com/Stan8/MicrobioRel.
keywords:
  - relation extraction
  - biomedical natural language processing
  - gut microbiome
  - information extraction
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-10-07
repository-code: "https://github.com/Stan8/MicrobioRel-RE"
